      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "ELECTRIC KUNA (1) finds it hard to win but looks close to breaking through. Has been in the money the last three starts, the latest when second (22.39) at this track. Solid record at the distance winning two races. Likely to be in the finish again. DID IT HAPPEN (8) had a tricky draw last time and although midfield in fourth wasn't far away finishing 3.5 lengths from the winner (22.46). Has a good record here at this journey. In the mix. LEO CAN BROWSE (5) collided with another runner last time and always well back when eighth (30.99) in a Grade 5/6 at Northam. Should be in this for a long way. SHADOW MAC (4) was in the money last start and poses a threat again.",
